<title>HONG KONG: Stone Elec to buy JV stake from parent.</title>
<headline>Stone Elec to buy JV stake from parent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone Electronic Technology Ltd said on Tuesday it would buy a 35 percent stake in an electrical and electronic equipment maker in China from its parent Stone Group Corp for US$17.35 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it would pay for the purchase through the issue of 94.71 million new Stone Electronic shares to its parent at HK$1.42 each.</p>
<p>Beijing Stone Matsushita Electric Works Ltd, a Sino-foreign joint venture in Beijing, makes and sells wiring devices, lighting fixtures, automatic door systems and health appliances under the &quot;National&quot; brand name.</p>
</text>
